SUMMARY:Asian Culture Center Fall 2026 Open House and Back to School Welc
 ome Reception
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we kick off another school year! Stop by and learn
  about the services\, programs\, and opportunities the Asian Culture Cent
 er offers. Informational tables from vibrant student groups will be at th
 e open house to welcome you! Be sure to stop by for friends\, delicious f
 ood\, fun games\, and information on the upcoming year!&#160\;&#160\;&#16
 0\;  &#160\;All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and&#16
 0\;educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU stu
 dents and other members of the Indiana University community.For more info
 rmation\, view this event in BeInvolved (https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/e
 vent/12469980).
