 interested in learning and discussing issues&#160\;impacting&#160\;the As
 ian American and Pacific Islander (AAPIs) and the general community. Lunc
 h&#160\;provided!  &#160\;All Indiana University events\, groups\, activi
 ties\, and&#160\;educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welc
 ome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University community
 .For more information\, view this event in BeInvolved (https://beinvolved
 .indiana.edu/event/12474516).
