LOCATION:Asian Culture Center (807 E 10th street\, Bloomington\, IN)
SUMMARY:Asian Cultures Around Campus: Mahjong Mondays
DESCRIPTION:Once associated with older generations\, Mahjong has now foun
 d a new home among the young.&#160\;Social clubs have&#160\;emerged&#160\
 ;dedicated to playing Mahjong to reconnect with culture and\, more import
 antly\, to foster new friendships. At the ACC\, we offer a casual and inf
 ormal Mahjong experience\, perfect for those looking to learn the game\, 
 take a break from the digital world\, and most importantly\, meet new fri
 ends in person. You do not need to be an expert to join us\, just bring y
 our enthusiasm and a willingness to learn!  &#160\;All Indiana University
  events\, groups\, activities\, and&#160\;educational\, cultural\, and hi
 storical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Ind
 iana University community.For more information\, view this event in BeInv
 olved (https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12470850).
